    "title": "Fox Cities service members honored this week ending Feb. 21 for their sacrifice in military service",
    "text": "The anniversaries of service members from Fox Cities who died while serving in war are observed this week ending Feb. 21. These remembrances include those who served in the Vietnam War, the Korean War, and other conflicts.\nValentine Bernard Vollmer\nDate of death: 2/16/1968\nWar: Vietnam War\nKenneth George Liebhaber\nDate of death: 2/17/1969\nWar: Vietnam War\nJames Nicholas Diedrich\nDate of death: 2/18/1970\nWar: Vietnam War\nJames Kenneth Schmoll\nDate of death: 2/20/1971\nWar: Vietnam War\nScott Brian Westphal\nDate of death: 2/21/1972\nWar: Vietnam War\nInformation in this story was obtained from the National Archives Catalog. The source data can be found here.",
